  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV Cross Border Initiative - Africa - Multicountry Southern Africa SADC (01-Apr-2015-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multicountry Southern Africa SADC, HIV, Southern African Development Community Secretariat (SADC)This program has the following goals: Reduce the HIV incidence and morbidity associated with HIV and AIDS, HIV/ TB co-infection Long Distanced Truck Drivers, Sex workers and communities around borders and mitigate their associated impact in the SADC region. The objectives of this program are: Objective 1: Strengthen harmonization of policies and related instruments to address HIV and AIDS among Long Distance Truck Drivers and Sex Workers and communities around the border.  Objective 2: Strengthen HIV and AIDS and STI prevention and treatment services for LDTDs, SWs and communities around the borders in the SADC region.  Objective 3: Strengthen institutional capacity to coordinate, manage and monitor LDTDs and SWs and communities around the border</narrative>
  </description>
